 "splits": {
  "31": [
   {
    "text": "Those who love me, I will deliver.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   },
   {
    "text": "Ugh!",
    "speaker": "Dr. Dave"
   }
  ],
  "58": [
   {
    "text": "You guys ID this gentleman?",
    "speaker": "Detective Colquitt"
   },
   {
    "text": "His name is Robert Jenkins, 23.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "75": [
   {
    "text": "...familiar to fans of Hammer horror films.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Of which, I am one, guilty.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "81": [
   {
    "text": "Sounds like a motive.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "83": [
   {
    "text": "That no hospital is gonna take those organs.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "But maybe we can find a use for them.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "92": [
   {
    "text": "They're called progressive lenses.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "No need to get defensive.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "93": [
   {
    "text": "I'm not defensive.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Presbyopia is a natural part...",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "94": [
   {
    "text": "...of the aging process.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "We're all gonna go through it, Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "118": [
   {
    "text": "A simple misunderstanding.",
    "speaker": "Barbara (on TV)"
   },
   {
    "text": "Uh-huh.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "175": [
   {
    "text": "Ugliness and pain.",
    "speaker": "Followers"
   },
   {
    "text": "No.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "187": [
   {
    "text": "Someone attacked us.",
    "speaker": "Technician"
   },
   {
    "text": "She killed Dr. Dave with a metal stake.",
    "speaker": "Technician"
   }
  ],
  "203": [
   {
    "text": "\"Vengeance is mine, I will repay.\"",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "That's what was on the organ cooler.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "206": [
   {
    "text": "No.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "When my brother Charlie was a baby...",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "209": [
   {
    "text": "I later learned that it was rheumatic fever.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Hmm.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "253": [
   {
    "text": "Our organs.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "Your excuses...",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "254": [
   {
    "text": "...don't solve the problem.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "I will find them.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "257": [
   {
    "text": "Barbara--",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   },
   {
    "text": "I think you'll agree...",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "264": [
   {
    "text": "Have I ever lied to you?",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "No.",
    "speaker": "Kayla"
   }
  ],
  "267": [
   {
    "text": "Close your eyes.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "Barbara, please.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "269": [
   {
    "text": "I wanna be beautiful like you.",
    "speaker": "Kayla"
   },
   {
    "text": "All right, my ugly duckling...",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "283": [
   {
    "text": "We're from the FBI.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "We'd like to ask a few questions.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "284": [
   {
    "text": "You have news about my Olivia?",
    "speaker": "Mrs. Bocanegra"
   },
   {
    "text": "We spoke to Father Hardy at St. Joseph's.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "289": [
   {
    "text": "Sorry, but we're trying to help.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Olivia doesn't wanna be found.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   }
  ],
  "298": [
   {
    "text": "I've given up on her.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   },
   {
    "text": "Have you?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "303": [
   {
    "text": "You wanna save her.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "You have to leave.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   }
  ],
  "305": [
   {
    "text": "Become an avenger.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I want her to be found...",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   }
  ],
  "321": [
   {
    "text": "Liar!",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "Barbara, this a dark time.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "323": [
   {
    "text": "Why can't we use one of them?",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "These children are our seeds.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "391": [
   {
    "text": "Whoops.",
    "speaker": "Joe (on TV)"
   },
   {
    "text": "Aah.",
    "speaker": "Barbara (on TV)"
   }
  ],
  "396": [
   {
    "text": "\"Double Trouble.\"",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   },
   {
    "text": "You've seen this a thousand times.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "400": [
   {
    "text": "You did that for me?",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "Everything I do.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "420": [
   {
    "text": "What do you know about the tenants?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "The only person I know is Barbara Beaumont.",
    "speaker": "Building Super"
   }
  ],
  "426": [
   {
    "text": "Gentlemen Prefer Blondes.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "TV Westerns. Dragnet.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "439": [
   {
    "text": "How long have you been a super here?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Seven years.",
    "speaker": "Building Super"
   }
  ],
  "440": [
   {
    "text": "Seven years, and you've never talked to her?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "All right, it's weird.",
    "speaker": "Building Super"
   }
  ],
  "444": [
   {
    "text": "Seven years and you've never crossed paths?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "She don't go out the front.",
    "speaker": "Building Super"
   }
  ],
  "445": [
   {
    "text": "What about the people on the fourth floor?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "They ever leave?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "462": [
   {
    "text": "Hello.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   },
   {
    "text": "Hello.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "474": [
   {
    "text": "Did you know Jack Webb?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I did not.",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "481": [
   {
    "text": "We're looking for an 85-year-old woman.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yes, well...",
    "speaker": "Barbara Beaumont"
   }
  ],
  "504": [
   {
    "text": "Those who love me, I will deliver.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   },
   {
    "text": "No!",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "540": [
   {
    "text": "We gotta get you to the hospital.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "This is what we want.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "541": [
   {
    "text": "Your experiment is over.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Not unless you want her to die first.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   }
  ],
  "543": [
   {
    "text": "We are all running out of time.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Luvenis"
   },
   {
    "text": "No!",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "546": [
   {
    "text": "Olivia.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   },
   {
    "text": "Juliet?",
    "speaker": "Olivia Bocanegra"
   }
  ],
  "547": [
   {
    "text": "What are you doing here?",
    "speaker": "Olivia Bocanegra"
   },
   {
    "text": "I came for you.",
    "speaker": "Juliet Bocanegra"
   }
  ],
  "550": [
   {
    "text": "Scully?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "554": [
   {
    "text": "You stink.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Thanks, Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "587": [
   {
    "text": "Reason and faith in harmony.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Isn't that why we're so good together?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ]
 },
 "text": {
  "16": "Shame to waste a good pancreas.",
  "86": "A liver has a \"need to use\" time limit on it.",
  "88": "I'll go on some onion sites and see if any organs were put up for auction.",
  "98": "...in the face of all this indifference and presbyopia.",
  "104": "[WOMAN CONTINUES PRAYING IN SPANISH]",
  "117": "It's as funny now as it was 50 years ago.",
