  "359": "...I'm going to do something very, very special.",
  "362": "I am going to perform my favorite song.",
  "365": "Higher than Charo or Muhammad Ali.",
  "370": "And so, Warren, to you I say....",
  "371": "[SINGING \"THE MORNING AFTER\"]",
  "394": "I don't want to be a suck-up....",
  "423": "[GROANING]",
  "478": "You--",
